{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"[{\"title\":\"Shinra Kusakabe Enlists\",\"number\":1,\"airDate\":\"2019-07-06\",\"duration\":24,\"synopsis\":\"On his first day with Special Fire Force Company 8, Shinra Kusakabe, a third-generation pyrokinetic who is able to produces flames from his feet, meets his fellow company members and begins to fulfil his wish of becoming a hero.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/series/355480/episodes/6904794.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"森羅 日下部, 入隊\"},{\"title\":\"The Heart of a Fire Soldier\",\"number\":2,\"airDate\":\"2019-07-13\",\"duration\":24,\"synopsis\":\"Arthur Boyle, the self-professed \\\"Knight King,\\\" arrives at Company 8, and immediately, there are tensions between him and Shinra. With the Rookie Games coming up, Hinawa wants to see what the two new recruits are really capable of.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/series/355480/episodes/7244048.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"消防官の心\"},{\"title\":\"The Rookie Fire Soldier Games\",\"number\":3,\"airDate\":\"2019-07-27\",\"duration\":24,\"synopsis\":\"Shinra and Arthur compete in the Rookie Fire Soldier Games, a contest to test the abilities of each year's newest recruits. However, they are interrupted at the goal by the mysterious man who created explosions at their last fire scene.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/series/355480/episodes/7244049.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"消防官新人大会\"},{\"title\":\"The Hero and the Princess\",\"number\":4,\"airDate\":\"2019-08-03\",\"duration\":24,\"synopsis\":\"A call mistakenly comes in to Company 8 to rescue a dog out of a tree, to which Shinra and Arthur respond. However, when an Infernal suddenly appears at the district courthouse, the two must play catch-up to join the rest of the company.\\r\\n\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/series/355480/episodes/7244052.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"ヒーローと姫\"},{\"title\":\"The Battle Begins\",\"number\":5,\"airDate\":\"2019-08-10\",\"duration\":24,\"synopsis\":\"While jogging, Shinra inadvertently disturbs Iris's purification rite, and sees that she is troubled. When Iris later turns up missing, the other members of Company 8 rally to Company 5's compound, to which Iris had secretly slipped away.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/series/355480/episodes/7244053.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"開戦\"},{\"title\":\"The Spark of Promise\",\"number\":6,\"airDate\":\"2019-08-17\",\"duration\":24,\"synopsis\":\"Shinra confronts Hibana in an attempt to rescue Iris, and must once again deal with her ability to make his body shut down. The story of Hibana and Iris's youth as orphans, as well as Hibana's rise to prominence, is revealed.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/series/355480/episodes/7244056.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"約束の火華\"},{\"title\":\"The Investigation of the 1st Commences\",\"number\":7,\"airDate\":\"2019-08-24\",\"duration\":24,\"synopsis\":\"The members of Company 5 and 8 get together for a cookout, ostensibly to celebrate a successful nighttime training exercise. Using the bylaws of the Special Fire Force, Obi gets Shinra and Arthur temporarily assigned to the 1st to investigate it.\\r\\n\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/series/355480/episodes/7244058.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"第1調査開始\"},{\"title\":\"Infernal Insects\",\"number\":8,\"airDate\":\"2019-08-31\",\"duration\":24,\"synopsis\":\"Obi goes over Hibana's research, and learns that the artificially-created Infernals she dissected all had traces of insect DNA in them. Shinra and Arthur's investigation at the 1st continues, and they finally get their first lead on a culprit.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/series/355480/episodes/7244062.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"焔の蟲\"},{\"title\":\"The Spreading Malice\",\"number\":9,\"airDate\":\"2019-09-07\",\"duration\":24,\"synopsis\":\"Tamaki watches on as Shinra confronts Rekka over his actions, and reminisces about how she once looked up to the lieutenant. Rekka reveals his objective in seeking out compatible children, one which could spell disaster for the entire world.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/series/355480/episodes/7244063.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"燃え拡がる悪意\"},{\"title\":\"The Promise\",\"number\":10,\"airDate\":\"2019-09-14\",\"duration\":24,\"synopsis\":\"A captains' conference is convened to allow the Special Fire Force to discuss the situation with the Evangelist and the White-Clad. Shinra once again has an encounter with Joker, in which startling information about Shinra's brother is revealed.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/series/355480/episodes/7244067.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"約束\"},{\"title\":\"Formation of Special Fire Force Company 8 / The Mightiest Hikeshi\",\"number\":11,\"airDate\":\"2019-09-21\",\"duration\":24,\"synopsis\":\"While Company 8 searches for clues about the Evangelist, Hinawa recounts the tale of how the company originally came into existence. A lead prompts the crew to pay a visit to Company 7's jurisdiction in Asakusa, and its captain, Benimaru.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/series/355480/episodes/7244070.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"第8特殊消防隊結成 / 最強の火消し\"},{\"title\":\"Eve of Hostilities in Asakusa\",\"number\":12,\"airDate\":\"2019-10-12\",\"duration\":24,\"synopsis\":\"Company 8 pitches in to help rebuild Asakusa after the latest Infernal incident, helping to gain the trust of its people. However, a White-Clad plot threatens to undo all of their goodwill, prompting Obi to take matters into his own hands.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/series/355480/episodes/7244077.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"浅草開戦前夜\"},{\"title\":\"The Trap Is Set\",\"number\":13,\"airDate\":\"2019-10-19\",\"duration\":24,\"synopsis\":\"With Konro's help, the members of the 8th begin investigating events in the 7th's jurisdiction. Chaos breaks out one dozens of cases of mistaken identity crop up, and the town's people turn on each other. The 8th comes under White-Clad attack.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/series/355480/episodes/7366294.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"仕組まれた罠\"},{\"title\":\"For Whom the Flames Burn\",\"number\":14,\"airDate\":\"2019-10-26\",\"duration\":24,\"synopsis\":\"As Asakusa burns around them, Konro encourages Benimaru to step into his role as a community leader. Benimaru devises a way for the townspeople to foil the designs of the impostors among the crowd. Konro reaches out to Shinra for help.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/series/355480/episodes/7366299.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"誰が為の炎\"},{\"title\":\"The Blacksmith`s Dream\",\"number\":15,\"airDate\":\"2019-11-02\",\"duration\":24,\"synopsis\":\"Viktor Licht is assigned to Company 8 as its forensic scientist, but he is viewed with suspicion, since the assignment came from Haijima. Obi sends Shinra, Arthur and Iris to speak to a man named Vulcan about joining the 8th as its engineer.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/series/355480/episodes/7366303.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"鍛冶屋の夢\"},{\"title\":\"We Are Family\",\"number\":16,\"airDate\":\"2019-11-09\",\"duration\":24,\"synopsis\":\"Vulcan teaches Yu a lesson in the importance of forging things that cannot be broken, and his hope to create similarly unbreakable family ties. Sensing a threat to Vulcan, the members of Company 8 take up positions to keep him safe.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/series/355480/episodes/7371307.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"俺たちは家族\"},{\"title\":\"Black and White and Gray\",\"number\":17,\"airDate\":\"2019-11-16\",\"duration\":24,\"synopsis\":\"While Dr. Giovanni continues to search Vulcan's workshop, Hibana comes to Shinra's aid, allowing him to rush back to help Vulcan. Meanwhile, Arthur has his hands full trying to deal with Mirage's illusions, and Iris resists in her own way.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/series/355480/episodes/7371308.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"黒と白と灰色\"},{\"title\":\"The Secrets of Pyrokinesis\",\"number\":18,\"airDate\":\"2019-11-23\",\"duration\":24,\"synopsis\":\"Vulcan gets settled in at the 8th, while Captain Obi meets with Hibana, Konro, and Karim to exchange data on the White-Clad matter. Konro proposes that Shinra and Arthur be given combat training in Asakusa to improve their fighting skills.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/series/355480/episodes/7371309.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"発火の極意\"},{\"title\":\"Into the Nether\",\"number\":19,\"airDate\":\"2019-11-30\",\"duration\":24,\"synopsis\":\"Licht's analysis of the attack on Vulcan's workshop reveals that the Evangelist's men have been in the \\\"Nether,\\\" the area beneath Tokyo. Company 8 proceeds underground in search of the White-Clad and the secrets behind human combustion.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/series/355480/episodes/7442072.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"地下への\"},{\"title\":\"Wearing His Pride\",\"number\":20,\"airDate\":\"2019-12-07\",\"duration\":24,\"synopsis\":\"Hinawa comes upon an abandoned subway station, where he gets into a shootout with Arrow. Arthur and Mirage find themselves in a rematch, as Arthur gets the chance to put the training he received from Benimaru and Konro to the test.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/series/355480/episodes/7466927.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"誇りを纏って\"},{\"title\":\"Those Connected\",\"number\":21,\"airDate\":\"2019-12-14\",\"duration\":24,\"synopsis\":\"Obi and Vulcan face off against Dr. Giovanni and Lisa, during which Giovanni tells Obi more about the nature of Adolla Bursts. Shinra has an unusual experience that leads him to find Sho, but their reunion proves more volatile than hoped for.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/series/355480/episodes/7466928.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"繋がる者\"},{\"title\":\"A Brother`s Determination\",\"number\":22,\"airDate\":\"2019-12-21\",\"duration\":24,\"synopsis\":\"As Shinra and Sho continue to share their Adolla Link, Shinra learns a startling truth about the origin of his Adolla Burst flame. Shinra comes to understand the Link's nature further, developing his skills even more in his effort to reach Sho.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/series/355480/episodes/7466930.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"兄の意地\"},{\"title\":\"Smile\",\"number\":23,\"airDate\":\"2019-12-28\",\"duration\":24,\"synopsis\":\"Shinra revisits his childhood to share his memories with Sho, to try to forge a deeper connection. When one of their own is critically injured, the members of the 8th rally to the rescue, and turn to Captain Huang of the 6th for assistance.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/series/355480/episodes/7466933.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"笑顔\"},{\"title\":\"The Burning Past\",\"number\":24,\"airDate\":\"2019-12-28\",\"duration\":24,\"synopsis\":\"Before being discharged from the hospital, Shinra is visited by Captain Burns, who offers to tell him all about the fire that happened 12 years ago, but only if Shinra can demonstrate that he is strong enough to hear the whole truth.\",\"thumbnail\":\"https://artworks.thetvdb.com/banners/series/355480/episodes/7466935.jpg\",\"titleJapanese\":\"燃ゆる過去\"}]","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":3600,"tags":[]}